@startuml 14_activity_provision
title Plug-and-play pairing (replaces manual CLI for end users)
start
:Install agent package; service starts without a reporting credential;
:Open local setup UI; accept data-collection notice;
:User selects Connect this device;
:Agent generates and stores strong reporting secret;
:POST pairing request with precommitted secret hash;
:API creates 10-minute code + private polling session;
:Show code in setup UI;
:Operator signs into Flutter Web;
:Operator enters pairing code;
:API verifies TTL, rate limits, JWT and workspace membership;
if (Authorized admin explicitly approves?) then (yes)
 :Atomically register workspace host and credential digest;
 :Agent polls with independent private session secret;
 if (Approval retrieved?) then (yes)
  :Persist host ID; start HTTPS monitoring;
  :First accepted sample establishes CONNECTED;
 else (no)
  :Retry safely or show expiration;
 endif
else (no)
 :Deny or expire pairing, never register host;
endif
stop
note right
 Pairing code never authenticates monitoring.
 Dashboard never handles long-lived agent credential.
end note
@enduml
